      "Find out the main ways resistance happens like gene changes and drug pumps.",
      "Explore some tricks to overcome resistance."
    ],
    "key_points": [
      "Gene mutations: cancer cells mutate and the drug can't hit the target anymore.",
      "Drug efflux: cells pump out the drug using proteins like P-gp, so the drug can't work.",
      "DNA repair boost: cells fix DNA damage fast, so chemo doesn't kill them.",
